stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "inbox-only" as inboxonly
  [*] --> pending: turn became pushable
  pending --> sending: gates open
  sending --> delivered: confirmed
  sending --> pending: send failed, control changed, breaker or conflict
  pending --> resolved: answered or superseded
  pending --> inboxonly: no push path
  sending --> inboxonly: no push path
  pending --> failed: binding changed or subscription ended
  class pending waiting
  class sending progress
  class delivered,inboxonly done
  class resolved done,gap
  class failed stopped
